The legal text in this repository

Source: NT Legislation (https://legislation.nt.gov.au), Office of Parliamentary Counsel, Northern Territory of
Australia. This is NOT an official version of Northern Territory legislation. For the official text go to
https://legislation.nt.gov.au.

Copyright in Northern Territory legislation is owned by the Northern Territory. Its copyright policy (Terms of Use,
https://legislation.nt.gov.au/en/Footer/Terms-of-Use, in effect from 8 October 1996) grants permission to any person
to publish or deal with any legislation of the Northern Territory on these conditions, which this repository keeps:
- the publication must not indicate directly or indirectly that it is an official version of the material;
- the arms of the Northern Territory must not be used in connection with the publication of the material; and
- the material must be accurately reproduced in a context that does not mislead.
The Northern Territory may revoke, vary or withdraw that permission on reasonable notice.

Changes made: the text of each reprint of each Act has been split into one file per provision (section, schedule,
schedule clause), with white space normalised (runs of spaces, tabs and line breaks are one space), soft hyphens left
out and non-breaking hyphens written as hyphens, table rows written as one line with cells joined by " | ", and the
history between reprints reconstructed into commits from each reprint's "as in force at" day and its endnotes. The
tables of provisions, covers, running headers and endnotes are not reproduced. The Northern Territory arms are not
reproduced. Neither the Office of Parliamentary Counsel nor the Northern Territory endorses this repository.

